(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "kotobase-engine の write path 構造（novelty log append = O(tx)、commit-dag state = {:indexed :novelty :t}）" "index fold（compaction）の決定性と償却モデル（K write に1回、内容アドレスゆえ server/browser で結果一致）" "read path 構造（cold-datoms range-pruned snapshot + novelty memory merge、retraction 上書き）" "per-actor content-addressed Datom log = actor identity の収束（actor = shard = AT-Proto repo = Radicle RID = kotoba graph = IPNS head）" "IPNS-signed per-actor head による trustless head resolution（Durable Object lock 置換、CAS を per-actor seq 単調性へ）" "browser-first runtime（injected block store port: R2/B2 ‖ IndexedDB+gateway ‖ mem、Merkle-verified read）" "security 3属性（CACAO/UCAN capability write、commit-dag verify-chain + Merkle proof、com.etzhayyim.encrypted.* XChaCha20 attribute envelope）")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "kotoba-datom-log-structured-engine-redesign"), (:adr/related (vector "adr-2605312345" "adr-2607032300" "adr-2605262130" "adr-2605181100" "adr-2607022600" "adr-2607022330")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607032430-kotoba-datom-log-structured-engine-redesign"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-03"), (:adr/body "本 ADR の正本 prose は同名 .md を参照（2607032430-kotoba-datom-log-structured-engine-redesign.edn）。要旨:\n\nkotoba Datom engine を log-structured per-actor substrate に再設計する。\n\n破綻（2026-07-03、321 actor mass identify 中の error 1102 = CF Worker CPU 超過）の\n根本原因は実装レベルで確定した: kotobase-engine の stateless write が hydrate\nO(graph) + prolly 4本 full rebuild O(graph) で、1 datom の write でも graph 全体を\n作り直していた。canonical doctrine（ADR-2605312345, Datom log = canonical）は既に\n正しく、log(novelty)/index 分離を規定しているが、実装が log を毎回 index に畳んで\nsnapshot 化してこれを裏切っていた。ADR-2607032300 は layer 分離（per-actor\nauthority）で『どこに置くか』を正したが engine 内部の O(graph) rebuild 構造は残し、\nincremental-insert を格下げ保留した。\n\n決定（engine 内部の HOW、ADR-2607032300 の layer 分離を補完）:\n- D1 Novelty log + 償却 fold: commit-dag の opaque state を {:indexed snap-cid\n  :novelty [tx-cid...] :t} に。write = tx block を put して novelty に prepend\n  = O(tx)。read = snapshot cold-datoms(range-pruned 既存) + novelty memory merge。\n  fold = novelty が閾値 K 超で background 畳込 = full rebuild を K write に償却\n  = O(graph_shard/K)。fold は内容アドレスゆえ決定的で分散 compaction 可。\n  prolly incremental insert 不要（格下げ課題を log-structured で回避）。\n- D2 Per-actor content-addressed Datom log: actor = shard = AT-Proto repo =\n  Radicle RID = kotoba graph = IPNS head の収束。単一 operator graph 撤廃。\n  write 競合は shard 内単一 writer = 消滅。\n- D3 IPNS-signed head: 可変点 = per-actor head を did:key 署名 IPNS record(seq↑)。\n  Durable Object lock 置換、trustless resolution、firehose = IPNS 前進イベント列、\n  Base L2 = commit-DAG root anchor。CAS は AppView/handle 索引のみ。\n- D4 Browser-first: engine cljc、block store injected port(R2/B2 ‖ IndexedDB+gateway\n  ‖ mem)。browser は自 shard を IndexedDB に、signed head→prolly Merkle proof で\n  trustless read(kotoba-client hydrate-via-blocks 既存)。同一 engine, port 差替のみ。\n- D5 Security: CACAO/UCAN capability write(graph=did 導出で cross-tenant 不可)、\n  verify-chain + Merkle proof、datom V を com.etzhayyim.encrypted.* XChaCha20\n  envelope(CID=ciphertext 上、Signal keyWrap、暗号化≠忘却)。\n\ncost: write O(total_graph) → O(tx) + 償却 O(graph_shard/K)。head O(N)→O(1)。\nper-actor sharding × amortization の相乗で CF Worker CPU 予算に構造的に収まる。\n\n実装: 新規 primitive ほぼ不要。prolly-tree/quad-store/kqe/cold-datoms/commit-dag/\nipld/dag-cbor/multiformats/cacao/signal/mst/kotoba-client は無変更。kotobase-engine\nの commit!(novelty-append)/read(merge)/fold! のみ変更。IPNS head 署名(現 follow-up)\nを必須要素に格上げ。\n\nmigration: (0)本 ADR (1)novelty-log write path (2)per-actor 配線(ADR-2607032300\nstep1-2) (3)IPNS head 署名 (4)browser engine (5)encrypted attributes。各段独立着地・\n後方互換(novelty 空 = 現状 snapshot-only 等価)。"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-03"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/relationship "{:faithfully-implements [\"adr-2605312345\"], :builds-on [\"adr-2607032300\"], :preserves [\"adr-2605262130\" \"adr-2605181100\" \"adr-2607022600\"], :retires [\"adr-2607022330-head-cas-for-per-actor-authority-write\"]}"), (:adr/title "ADR-2607032430: kotoba Datom engine 再設計 — log-structured per-actor substrate（novelty log + 償却 index fold）, browser-first, IPNS-signed heads"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))